*Previously, the spirit tree in the [[Tree Gnome Village (location)|Tree Gnome Village]] served as a network hub. All the other trees would only teleport the player to the Tree Gnome Village, and then players could use the central tree to teleport to all the others.
*Spirit tree [[chathead]]s ([[:File:Spirit tree (ancient) chathead (full).png|ancient]]/[[:File:Spirit tree (young) chathead (full).png|young]]) are considerably larger than they appear in the chatbox.

